UPSTREAM HISTORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
RikkaRP was initially based on RikkaHub 3.1.0
(commit eeef60b22ba24383daf51f3c6c2e5b75bbab6bba) and was subsequently
merged with upstream 3.1.1 (commit ad2c4430d50ba52392b2941367f98ef59614cb73).
The git history of this repository records that lineage.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
MODIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
In accordance with AGPL-3.0 section 5(a), modifications made by this fork are
recorded in the repository's git history with descriptive commit messages.
Summary of modifications (non-exhaustive):

  * Renamed the application to "RikkaRP" and changed the applicationId to
    io.github.flanski.rikkarp so it can be installed alongside upstream.
  * Replaced the Material 3 Expressive UI with a right-angled "Sharp" design
    system; reworked the conversation list into a standalone messages page
    used as the launch screen; added a bottom navigation bar and swipe
    actions on conversation items.
  * Removed Firebase / analytics / in-app purchase components.
  * Reused a prebuilt libtermux.so for the :terminal module instead of
    building it from source.

